       <h1>&quot;Dhurandhar The Revenge&quot; TV Premiere Faces Significant CBFC Cuts</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Entertainment</span> <span>#Bollywood</span> <span>#Film</span> <span>#CBFC</span></div>
       <p>The action saga &quot;Dhurandhar The Revenge,&quot; released in 2026, is set for its television premiere on Star Gold on Sunday, October 18, at 7:00 pm, following a successful run in cinemas and impressive viewership on OTT platforms. However, its broadcast debut will feature a significantly altered version due to mandates from the Central Board of Film Certification (CBFC).</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-09-30/dhurandhar-the-revenge-tv-premiere-faces-significant-cbfc-cu.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Originally certified 'A' for its theatrical release, the film underwent review by the CBFC for its television airing. The board has reportedly ordered between 45 to 50 cuts to the movie. This extensive editing is standard procedure for films transitioning from an adult rating to a family-friendly broadcast.</p><p>As a result of these modifications, the television version of &quot;Dhurandhar The Revenge&quot; will be approximately 10 minutes shorter than its original cut. The edited film will carry a U/A 16+ rating, indicating suitability for viewing by individuals aged 16 and above, under parental guidance.</p><p>The substantial changes highlight the stringent censorship requirements for content aired on Indian television, particularly for films that initially received an 'A' certificate. Viewers anticipating the premiere should be aware of the revised content.</p><p>What to watch: How the edited version of &quot;Dhurandhar The Revenge&quot; is received by television audiences.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The draft accurately summarizes the provided source regarding the film's TV premiere and censorship requirements.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.bollywoodhungama.com/news/bollywood/exclusive-cbfc-orders-45-50-cuts-for-dhurandhar-the-revenges-tv-premiere-u-a-16-version-is-10-minutes-shorter/" rel="noopener">Bollywood Hungama</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
