      <ul><li><a href="https://www.crictracker.com/cricket-news/india-will-get-better-with-time-says-abhishek-nayar-on-bowling-ahead-of-2nd-odi-vs-west-indies/" rel="noopener">Crictracker</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
