       <h1>Modi, Trump discuss India-US trade, defense, energy ties</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#India</span> <span>#United States</span> <span>#Modi</span> <span>#Trump</span></div>
       <p>Prime Minister Modi and President Trump have engaged in discussions concerning a range of bilateral issues, focusing specifically on trade, defense, and energy ties between India and the United States. This high-level interaction underscores the multifaceted nature of the strategic partnership between the two global powers.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-09-30/modi-trump-discuss-india-us-trade-defense-energy-ties.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>The dialogue covered aspects of trade relations, indicating ongoing efforts to strengthen economic cooperation and address any existing imbalances or opportunities for growth. Both leaders' engagement on trade highlights its importance in the broader India-US relationship, reflecting a shared interest in fostering a robust economic environment.</p><p>Furthermore, defense ties were a key component of their discussions. This emphasis points to continued collaboration in the security sector, potentially encompassing joint exercises, technology transfers, or strategic alignment on regional and global security challenges. The focus on defense underscores the deepening military-to-military cooperation and strategic convergence between India and the United States.</p><p>Energy ties also featured prominently in the talks. This suggests a mutual interest in securing energy resources, promoting sustainable energy solutions, or exploring new partnerships in the energy sector. The discussions between Prime Minister Modi and President Trump reinforce the comprehensive scope of the India-US strategic partnership, spanning critical areas of global importance.</p><p>What to watch: Official readouts or subsequent policy announcements detailing outcomes or future initiatives stemming from these discussions.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The article appropriately expands on the themes mentioned in the source summary.</p>
