      <ul><li><a href="https://india.mongabay.com/short-article/2026/09/new-toad-species-described-in-northeastern-sky-islands/" rel="noopener">Mongabay India</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
