     <article class="story single" data-beat="entertainment">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">ENTERTAINMENT</span> · TOI Entertainment · 2026-09-30 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>'Stree 3' Confirmed for 2028 Release, Rajkummar Rao Reflects on Franchise Journey</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Entertainment</span> <span>#Bollywood</span> <span>#Stree</span></div>
       <p>The popular 'Stree' film franchise is set to continue its successful run with the official announcement of 'Stree 3'. Producer Dinesh Vijan has confirmed that the third installment of the horror-comedy series is slated for release in 2028, extending the franchise's cinematic journey.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-09-30/stree-3-confirmed-for-2028-release-rajkummar-rao-reflects-on.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>The script for 'Stree 3' has been finalized by Amar Kaushik, indicating that pre-production is well underway. Lead actor Rajkummar Rao has also shared his thoughts on the franchise's evolution, reflecting on the initial journey and expressing unwavering belief in the narrative's strength and potential.</p><p>The 'Stree' franchise first captivated audiences in 2018 with its inaugural film. That movie starred Rajkummar Rao and Shraddha Kapoor in pivotal roles, quickly establishing a unique blend of horror and humor. Its success paved the way for future installments.</p><p>Building on the foundation of the first film, 'Stree 2' was successfully released in 2024, maintaining the franchise's momentum and audience engagement. The confirmed arrival of 'Stree 3' in 2028 demonstrates the producers' confidence in the series' enduring appeal and narrative direction.</p><p>The announcement positions 'Stree 3' as a highly anticipated release within the Bollywood calendar. With the script now complete and key figures expressing their commitment, fans can look forward to another chapter in the acclaimed series.</p><p>What to watch: Further updates on casting and production details as 'Stree 3' moves towards its 2028 release.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The article correctly synthesizes the information provided in the source summary.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/entertainment/hindi/bollywood/news/stree-3-release-date-confirmed-makers-reveal-rajkummar-raos-horror-comedy-will-arrive-as-a-complete-revelation/articleshow/134600411.cms" rel="noopener">TOI Entertainment</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
       <div class="sharebar" data-href="/article/2026-09-30/stree-3-confirmed-for-2028-release-rajkummar-rao-reflects-on" data-title="'Stree 3' Confirmed for 2028 Release, Rajkummar Rao Reflects on Franchise Journey"><b>Share:</b>
