       <h1>WATCH: Rohit Sharma celebrates in jubilation during Guwahati ODI</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Rohit Sharma</span> <span>#Cricket</span> <span>#ODI</span> <span>#Century</span></div>
       <p>Cricket fans in Guwahati were treated to a spectacular display of batting prowess as Rohit Sharma lit up the ODI with a magnificent century. The veteran opener, renowned for his ability to accelerate and dominate, crafted an innings of pure class, reaching a memorable 101 runs from a mere 75 deliveries. This performance wasn't just about the numbers; it was about the sheer authority with which he commanded the crease.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-09-30/watch-rohit-sharma-celebrates-in-jubilation-during-guwahati-.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>The atmosphere in Guwahati was electric as Sharma unleashed a flurry of strokes, blending elegant timing with powerful hitting. Every boundary was met with thunderous applause, and his quick progression towards the three-figure mark kept spectators on the edge of their seats. The jubilation that followed his hundred was palpable, a moment of shared celebration between the player and the passionate crowd, underscoring the significance of his individual effort in the context of the match.</p><p>Sharma's rapid-fire century provided a formidable impetus, laying a solid foundation for the team. His ability to score at such a brisk pace, especially in an ODI format, is a testament to his exceptional skill and current form. Such pivotal innings not only boost the team's scoreboard but also exert considerable pressure on the opposing side, influencing the flow and strategy of the game. Rohit Sharma continues to prove his invaluable contribution, delivering impactful performances when his team needs them most.</p><p>What to watch: The continuing impact of his aggressive batting style on team strategies.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The draft accurately reflects the source summary with appropriate journalistic elaboration.</p>
